  "ST_Tutorials": {
    "tut_meta_map01_description": "\t\r\nKing�s untimely death kicked off a gang war in Rockay City. Help Travis Baker defeat his opponents and secure the crown!\r\n\r\nMake your strategic moves on the <BigEm>MAP</>, be it taking over territories or robbing banks.",
    "tut_meta_detectives01_description": "<BigEm>DETECTIVES</> are the Sheriff's elite investigators. They effectively clear the territories from criminal activity. A cleared territory turns neutral after a day.\r\n\r\nGetting loud during a mission in the vicinity of detectives attracts their attention. Killing a detective during a mission reduces <BigEm>INVESTIGATION</>.",
    "tut_meta_missions01_description": "<BigEm>MISSIONS</> are your main source of income. They differentiate in their type, risk, planning cost and reward.\r\n\r\nAs your <BigEm>RESPECT</> grows, the missions will become more dangerous with bigger rewards.",
    "tut_meta_planningboard01_description": "<BigEm>PLANNING BOARD</> illustrates your progress in the current story plotline. It also contains more detailed information and allows you to start the missions in question.",
    "tut_meta_assets01_title": "Acquiring Assets",
    "tut_meta_debrief01_description": "After most missions you see the debrief, where you can see how you finished the mission.\r\n\r\nYou can see the how much money and loot you brought, state of your heister and your star rating.\r\n\r\nYou can see more detail by clicking on More Details.",
    "mp_menu_prestige_last_title": "All Magazines Collected",
    "tut_meta_lobby01_description": "Assign the right team members for the upcoming mission.\r\n\r\nNote the team�s gear, stats and mission cut.",
    "tut_meta_turfattack01_title": "Attacking Territories",
    "tut_meta_entourage01_title": "Baker�s Entourage",
    "tut_meta_roguelite1_description": "Baker�s death means the end of the current run. But the game is far from over!\r\n\r\nThere�s still more heists and stories to discover. Choose your bonuses, improve your chances and try again!",
    "mp_menu_hub01_description": "Become a Rockay City legend by pulling off heists with your crew! Work together, climb the ranks, and make a name for yourself in the criminal underworld.\r\n\r\nTry <BigEm>CUSTOMIZING</> your character in the <BigEm>BOSS</> tab to stand out�or blend in�and make sure you're ready for the next job!",
    "mp_menu_boss_description": "Become a true <BigEm>BOSS</> by stealing and robbing together with your friends! Assemble the ultimate crew and heist your way to the top of Rockay City!\r\n\r\nGo to the <BigEm>PLAY</> tab once you�re finished <BigEm>CUSTOMIZING</> your boss.",
    "mp_menu_boss_customization_title": "Boss Customization",
    "tut_meta_bosslevel01_title": "Boss Level",
    "tut_meta_claimturf02_title": "Capturing Territories",
    "tut_meta_investigation02_description": "Careful, Sheriff�s <BigEm>INVESTIGATION</> into you is close to completion!\r\n\r\nOnce it�s complete, the police will attempt to strike you down.",
    "tut_meta_charmission01_title": "Character Missions",
    "tut_meta_turfclaim01_title": "Claiming Territories",
    "tut_meta_turfattack01_description": "Claiming an <BigEm>ENEMY TERRITORY</> requires that you defeat the enemy gang in combat. You can balance the amount of sent soldiers and spent money with a slider.\r\n\r\nAttack the enemy territory.",
    "tut_meta_sheriff01_description": "Criminal activities raise the <BigEm>HEAT</>, making missions more dangerous. Heat drops at the start of a new day.\r\n\r\nTo stop your advance, the relentless Sheriff gradually collects more evidence � which is conveyed by <BigEm>INVESTIGATION</>.\r\n\r\nConquer Rockay City before Sheriff completes his investigation into your activities.",
    "mp_menu_boss_customization_description": "Customize your boss to your liking! Unlock new items, skins and more by <BigEm>LEVELING UP</>!\r\n\r\nYou retain all purchased unlockables even upon death in a mission.",
    "tut_meta_permadeath01_title": "Death",
    "tut_meta_debrief01_title": "Debriefing",
    "tut_meta_warehouse01_title": "Defending Properties",
    "tut_meta_turfdefense01_title": "Defending Territories",
    "tut_meta_detectives01_title": "Detectives",
    "tut_meta_roguelite1_title": "End Of Run",
    "tut_meta_endday01_title": "Ending the Day",
    "tut_meta_respect01_description": "Expanding your territory increases your <BigEm>RESPECT</>. \r\n\r\nWith each respect level gained, you�ll have access to bigger rewards, better missions, stronger weapons, and new team members.\r\n\r\nIncreasing respect also gives boss experience, granting unlocks for various boss bonuses.",
    "mp_menu_chains_description_page1": "Experience Rockay City's <BigEm>URBAN LEGENDS</>! No holds barred cooperative mini-stories that can be played with bots and players alike.\r\n\r\nChoose from a pre-selected pool of characters and try to succeed without replenished revives between missions.",
    "tut_meta_charmission01_description": "Explore the standalone stories of unique individuals.\r\n\r\nThe completion of these missions is <BigEm>SAVED ACROSS RUNS</>, unless the team member dies outside of their character missions.",
    "mp_menu_chains_description_page2": "Finishing an urban legend unlocks the next one in the selection. Replay them to earn a better score and star rating.\r\n\r\nCompleting an urban legend with a three-star rating will give you a nice cash bonus on top.",
    "tut_meta_goal01_title": "Goals",
    "tut_meta_investigation02_title": "High Investigation",
    "tut_meta_hirearmy01_title": "Hiring Soldiers",
    "tut_meta_entourage01_description": "In the <BigEm>ENTOURAGE</> tab you will find an overview of your closest advisors and their respective persistent bonuses � which you collect through raising your boss level.",
    "tut_meta_office01_description": "In the <BigEm>OFFICE</> tab you can manage your financials � sell loot from your stash, take out a loan or buy assets to spruce up your office.",
    "tut_meta_teamtab01_description": "In the <BigEm>TEAM</> tab, you manage your team of specialists. You can change their gear, promote them, dismiss or hire new ones. Team members can be used for one mission per day. For each mission, they gain experience towards a <BigEm>PROMOTION</>.\r\n\r\nBe careful � a team member�s death is <BigEm>PERMANENT</>!",
    "mp_menu_team_description": "In the Team tab you can acquire new <BigEm>TEAM MEMBERS</> to complete your crew.\r\n\r\nAcquired team members are not lost upon their death.",
    "tut_meta_sheriff01_title": "Investigation and Heat",
    "tut_meta_loan01_title": "Loans",
    "tut_meta_office01_title": "Managing Finances",
    "tut_meta_teamtab01_title": "Managing Your Team",
    "tut_meta_lobby01_title": "Mission Lobby",
    "tut_meta_missions01_title": "Missions",
    "tut_meta_heat02_description": "Participating in criminal activities � such as robberies or attacking turfs � raises the <BigEm>HEAT</>. Raised heat signifies stronger response from the police.\r\n\r\nThe heat drops at the start of a new day.",
    "tut_meta_planningboard01_title": "Planning board",
    "mp_menu_prestige_first_title": "Prestige",
    "tut_meta_bosslevel01_description": "Progressing in your run and buying assets earns you <BigEm>BOSS POINTS</> that contribute to a <BigEm>BOSS LEVEL</> up.\r\n\r\nWith each boss level, you can select one out of three persistent bonuses. These bonuses help you across all runs.",
    "tut_meta_progression_title": "Progression",
    "tut_meta_promote01_title": "Promotion",
    "tut_meta_assets01_description": "Purchasing <BigEm>ASSETS</> contributes to your <BigEm>BOSS POINTS</> gain while also decorating your office.\r\n\r\nThe assets stay in your possession across all runs.",
    "tut_meta_heat02_title": "Raising Heat",
    "tut_meta_respect01_title": "Respect",
    "mp_menu_horde_mode_title": "Rockay Rumble",
    "tut_meta_promote01_description": "Sending a team member on missions gives them experience � eventually qualifying them for <BigEm>PROMOTION</>.\r\n\r\nPromotion increases overall stats, mission cut, adds perks and also equipment.",
    "tut_meta_debrief02_title": "Stars and Clean Execution",
    "tut_meta_debrief02_description": "Stars influence hotness of the loot and money. Every missing star increases the fencing cost.\r\n\r\nAcquiring stars:\r\n\r\n1st star � Finish the main objective\r\n\r\n2nd star � Clean execution � don�t kill civilians and don�t lose any heister\r\n\r\n3rd star � Special objective � different smaller challenges, don�t forget to check them before the mission in the mission detail. During the mission you can see their state under the main objective",
    "tut_meta_stash01_title": "Stash",
    "tut_meta_stash01_description": "Stolen commodities, such as drugs and electronics, are stored in your <BigEm>STASH</>.\r\n\r\nSell them at the peak of their market value to gain a cash boost for your operation.\r\n\r\nOr hold onto the commodities and discover their alternative uses.",
    "tut_meta_permadeath01_description": "Taking Baker to a mission grants you many advantages, such as <BigEm>BONUS REWARD</> with 0% mission cut and completing two missions a day.\r\n\r\nBeware that Baker�s death results in the <BigEm>END OF THE RUN</>.",
    "mp_menu_team_title": "Team",
    "mp_menu_shuffle_description_page1": "Test your heisting skills to the fullest in a randomized sequence of missions � <BigEm>SHUFFLE</>!\r\n\r\nOvercome all missions in the sequence and get a hefty bonus on top of the regular mission rewards. The longer tiers come with superior prizes. However, their missions may prove to be more challenging.",
    "tut_meta_weakenmission01_description": "There are different ways to conquer Rockay City. Some available missions do not give you financial rewards. \r\n\r\nInstead, completing them helps you in turf war � by weakening the rival boss or taking over enemy territory.",
    "tut_meta_loan01_description": "To avoid running out of cash, consider taking out a <BigEm>LOAN</>.\r\n\r\nNotice the loan repayment conditions to avoid complete bankruptcy.",
    "mp_menu_hub_title": "WELCOME TO CRIME BOSS CO-OP!",
    "tut_meta_weakenmission01_title": "Weaken Bosses",
    "mp_menu_horde_mode_description": "Welcome to <BigEm>ROCKAY RUMBLE</>! Step into the seasonal arena armed with the fiercest combat perks, choose your weapon of glory, and prepare for waves of enemies hungry for defeat. \r\n\r\nKill enemies � collect rewards � earn shop tokens � spend tokens on upgrades. \r\n\r\nCo-operate, adapt, <BigEm>SURVIVE</>� Because only the strongest make it out of <BigEm>ROCKAY RUMBLE</>!",
    "mp_menu_boss_title": "Welcome to Crime Boss Multiplayer!",
    "tut_meta_map01_title": "Welcome to Rockay City!",
    "mp_menu_prestige_first_description": "Well done, Boss! You have reached <BigEm>PRESTIGE</> level <BigEm>BRONZE</>. Complete more jobs and level up to reach the next tier.",
    "tut_meta_endday01_description": "When your resources  are depleted (such as available team members and army), <BigEm>END THE DAY</>.\r\n\r\nEnding the day refreshes your team, army and the heat from police. It also lets your enemies make their move.",
    "tut_meta_progression_description": "You <BigEm>LEVEL UP</> by playing missions and gaining XP points.\r\n\r\nWith every level you unlock new items, skins and more which can then be bought in <BigEm>CAMPAIGN</> and <BigEm>MULTIPLAYER</>.",
    "tut_meta_turfclaim01_description": "You can claim a <BigEm>NEUTRAL TERRITORY</> for yourself by sending soldiers and spending money.\r\n\r\nClaim your first territory.",
    "tut_meta_turfclaim02_description": "You can claim a neutral turf for yourself by spending soldiers and money.\r\n\r\nClaim your first turf.",
    "mp_menu_prestige_last_description": "You have unlocked all purchasable items from the progression system. Any future level-ups will grant a substantial amount of money for your Co-Op Boss. When new unlockable content is introduced in future updates, you will automatically receive the corresponding magazines.",
    "mp_menu_shuffle_description_page2": "You receive rewards for each successful mission you complete, even if you ultimately fail before reaching the end of the round.\r\n\r\nHowever, if you are successful, you obtain additional money.",
    "tut_meta_hirearmy01_description": "Your <BigEm>SOLDIERS</> are essential in turf war. They die and are spent during attacks and defense.\r\n\r\n<BigEm>HIRE</> more soldiers to keep expanding.",
    "tut_meta_goal01_description": "Your primary goal is to conquer Rockay City, but there are many ways to get closer to the crown.\r\n\r\nThe <BigEm>GOALS</> tab allows you to select and keep track of your short-term objectives.",
    "tut_meta_warehouse01_description": "Your property is under attack! A rival gang is attempting to steal cash and resources from turfs under your protection.\r\n\r\n<BigEm>DEFEND</> your property. By doing it well, you may put a dent into the enemy forces.\r\n\r\nComplete the special objective to <BigEm>LOWER ARMY TIER</> of the attacking gang (if possible).",
    "tut_meta_turfdefense01_description": "Your territory is under attack from an enemy gang! Touchdown defends the territories personally with backup from your soldiers.\r\n\r\nIgnoring or losing the <BigEm>DEFENSE</> gives the territory to the enemy."
  },
